  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#0f0\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#9b59b6\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/DreamForgeStudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0M8mHGS/Photoroom-20241208-183732-9.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/KVTP9SqQ3x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/2MXprcq/Photoroom-20241208-183731-6.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252fdreamforgestudio%252fdonate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gMntqZj/Photoroom-20241208-183732-8.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#0f0\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#9b59b6\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#0f0\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#9b59b6\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/DreamForgeStudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/c/DreamForgeStudio</a> 尝试资源包和附加选项 KingdomCome 256x 512x 1280x</strong></span></span></span><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ZctPJRj/Photoroom-20241208-183731-2.png\"><br>Dreamforge 是一个将艺术技巧与技术卓越完美融合的独特工作室。沉浸于高品质纹理与模型的世界，创作出令人着迷并激发灵感的视觉作品。每一个细节都倾注了热爱与匠心，彰显我们对完美成果的执着追求。<br><br>我们的团队不懈地测试并打磨每一个模型，力求达到极致的写实感与表现力。在不断的打磨循环中，我们寻找材质与光影的完美搭配，让每一处纹理都焕发生机。这项艰苦却充满乐趣的工作需要耐心与勤奋，我们为过程中的每一步感到自豪。<br><br>在 <span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#9b59b6\">Dreamforge</span>，我们相信真正的美蕴藏于细节之中。我们创造的不仅是模型与纹理，更是一个能带领观众踏上精彩旅程的完整世界。</span><br>本模组免费提供，若能得到您的捐赠，我们将不胜感激。<span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#c9f\"><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252fdreamforgestudio%252fdonate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/JKVwBgs/1733561533172.png\" width=\"256\" height=\"100\"></a><br>MetaMask</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#8e44ad\">0x5A3Fe4Bb9f2A83Bbd1b560Ac45EA0525012E92a7</span><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ZctPJRj/Photoroom-20241208-183731-2.png\"><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:24px;color:#d35400\">尝试资源包和附加选项 <span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">=Alternate Reality=</span></span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#f29d12\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/alternative-reality-ar-64x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">64x</a></span>,</span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#27ae60\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/alternative-reality-ar-128x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">128x</a></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#18a085\">,</span></span> <span style=\"color:#18a085\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#d35400\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/alternative-reality-ar-128x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">256x</a></span></span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">兼容版本：</span></span><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:18px\">1.21.x <span style=\"color:#d35400\">原版</span> , </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#f29d12\">Forge + Optifine</span>, </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:18px;color:#27ae60\">Fabric + Iris</span><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:18px\">新增 GUI（Alpha 测试版）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:18px;color:#3598db\">无需安装 Optifine<br>为正确显示植被，请在图形设置中将其设为：<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">FANCY</span></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/grZRtQV/huge-2022-12-17-17-21-49.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2022/521/16260403-huge_l.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2022/521/16210514_l.webp\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2022/521/16210483_l.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2022/521/16210487_l.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2022/521/16260404-huge_l.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f90\">-----------------更新计划--------------------</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f90\">优化纹理与模型</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f90\">添加新纹理与模型</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f90\">更多样化的内容</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f90\">实体纹理</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f90\">界面（GUI）</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f90\">以及其他纹理</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f90\">--------------------------------------------</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#0ff\">推荐光影包：</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#0ff\">===============================</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#0ff\">BSL<br>AstraLex Shaders (BSL 修改版)<br>Insanity-Shader<br>Solas-Shader<br>Sildurs+Vibrant+Shaders</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#0ff\">===============================</span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/DreamForgeStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#e67e23\">====================================================================================</span><br><span style=\"font-family